language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Three sum: select exactly m of the given integers so that the selected integers sum to zero.
$ number of integers, from the instance nums list
given nums_dim1 : int
given nums : matrix indexed by [int(1..nums_dim1)] of int
given m : int
$ indices[i] is true when the integer nums[i] is selected
find indices : matrix indexed by [int(1..nums_dim1)] of bool
such that
$ exactly m elements are selected
(sum i : int(1..nums_dim1) . toInt(indices[i])) = m,
$ the selected elements sum to zero
(sum i : int(1..nums_dim1) . toInt(indices[i]) * nums[i]) = 0
